# Before/After With Int Range Example
# Before/after on a concept whose initial values are generated with Int Range plus Values anchors.
# Demonstrates extensions inserting sentinels at both ends of an Int-Range-based concept.
# From Story125/Story126/Story201: CPL Concepts Parser/Analyzer - Before/After
#
# Note: Integer-valued anchors (e.g., `before 1`) require INTEGER in the identifier rule.
# Use Values-based anchors around Int Range values until that support is added.

concepts
	# Base concept with Int Range numeric values plus string anchor points
	Scale=[Values[Start], Int[1, 5, 1], Values[End]]

concepts
	# Insert a priority flag before the anchor Start
	Scale=[Values[Priority]] before Start

	# Insert a final flag after the anchor End
	Scale=[Values[Final]] after End
